# Environment files. These carry the API URL and the Google OAuth client id per
# environment; only the committed templates belong in git. `.env.development` is
# already tracked and stays that way — gitignore does not affect tracked files,
# and it holds shared dev defaults, no secrets.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

